"object.commercial_partner_id.id\">Guten Tag <t t-out=\"object.name or ''\"/> "
"(<t t-out=\"object.commercial_partner_id.name or ''\"/>),</t>\n"
"                    <t t-else=\"\">Guten Tag <t t-out=\"object.name or ''\"/"
">,</t>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    Anbei finden Sie die Liste Ihrer offenen Rechnungen.\n"
